  "title": "Rivalry_Tagging",
  "description": "Rivalry_Tagging is a neuroimaging dataset of binocular rivalry recordings collected between February and March 2014. Trials include events for pattern presentation (pattern1, pattern2), left and right tap responses, baseline periods, and non-rivalry color (green/red) conditions. Trigger channels (UDIO001, UPPT001) are provided to align stimulus and response events.",
